mode: "100644"
text: "# The TEST framework — evidence, not vibes\n\nMost \"testing\" on social is vibes: post two things, eyeball the likes, declare a winner, learn nothing.\nTEST is the discipline that turns guesses into evidence — and establishes **causation** (the thing\nobservation alone can't). Setting the target is `goals-and-kpis`; reading the result is\n`analytics-and-reporting`; **isolating what moves it is here.**\n\n## T — Target one variable\n- Write a clear **hypothesis** (\"a question-hook beats a stat-hook on saves\"). Change **one element** —\n  hook / first-frame / caption / CTA / time / format — and keep **everything else identical.**\n- Pick the **one variable with the most leverage** on your KPI (often the hook on short video).\n\n## E — Establish the decision rule first\n- **Before publishing**, set the **primary metric + win threshold + guardrail**: *\"B wins if reach +15%\n  and saves-per-reach not worse.\"* Anchor the primary metric to the **KPI** (`goals-and-kpis`).\n- Pre-committing kills post-hoc rationalizing — you can't move the goalposts to fit the result.\n\n## S — Set controls + sample\n- **Control the context:** same platform, format, similar topic/length, similar **posting window.**\n- **Run long enough:** ≥7 days (small accounts ~2–4 weeks). Organic can't hit true significance → judge\n  on a **~20%+ consistent effect**, not a squeaker. A **tie** means \"test elsewhere.\"\n\n## T — Tally, repeat, scale\n- **3–5 paired repetitions** before you call it a \"best practice\" — one winner is noise.\n- **Document** every test (hypothesis/variant/result/learning) in a log. **Scale** proven winners into\n  the playbook (`content-recycling`) and feed `social-strategy`; retire what tied/lost.\n\n## The experiment brief a request should fill\n```\nHYPOTHESIS: changing [variable] will improve [primary metric tied to a KPI]\nVARIABLE: the ONE element changing (everything else identical)\nCONTROL: same platform/format/topic/length/posting window\nPRIMARY METRIC + DECISION RULE: e.g. \"B wins if saves/reach +20%\" (set before publishing)\nGUARDRAIL: the metric that must not get worse\nDURATION + REPS: >=7 days (small acct 2-4 wks); 3-5 paired tests\nREADOUT: native analytics (analytics-and-reporting); log it; scale or drop\n```\n"
